<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">2 Johan</book>
  <para style="h">2 Johan</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Johan</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Johan</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Johan</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei upa in, tel tuom numei leh atate thutah a ka itte kungah tualeh kei guoh hilou in, thutah thei zousie in zong ahing it uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Eima a um tualeh kumtawn a zong ikunga umden ding thutah zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pa pasien akipat leh Mangpa Jesu Khrist, Pa Pasian Tapa akipat hepina, khotuona leh hamuonna in thutah leh itna toh noute hing umpita hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pa kunga kipat a thupieh imu banga, natate pawl khat thutah a um ka mu ziehin ka kipah mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh tuin numei zatat huoi aw, thupieh tha hing giel bang hilou in, achiil a kipata ineisa uh hing giel hizawin, ki it tuo chiet dingin ka hing ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tami ahi itna: Athupiehte bang a i umna khu ahi. Thupieh khu tami ahi, achiila kipata na zahsa bang ua na zui ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen Jesu Khrist tahsain ahing pei chia phuonglou solhat mi tampi leitung ah apawtkheta uhi. Tuabang mite pouma khu mi solhat leh Khrist doudalmi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Isepkhietsa silte mansuo lou a, kipahman akima imuthei zawhna dingun kiveng un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi koipou dan palsan leh Khrist thugin kihilna dana umlouten Pasian anei sih hi. Khrist thuhilna a umden miin pen, Pa leh Tapa aniin aneikhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi koipou tami thugin kithuhilna keng loua na kung ua hing pei a um leh, na inn uah tungsah sih unlen, kamdam in zong na lamdawn sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen tuabang mi na vaidawn mi in, agamtat gilou akitaanpi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na kung ua thu tampi hing gel ding ka nei vangin laipeh leh laitui in ka giel ut sih hi, hinanleh na kung ua hing haw a, i kipahna uh akim theina dingin kimaituo a thugen ka kinem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tel tuoma um na sanggamnu taten Mangpha ahing hah uhi. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
